    "title": "EASY-nLC™ 1200 System",
    "excerpt":"A compact nano-flow UHPLC system   The EASY-nLC combines simplicity and high-throughput capacity in a nano-flow UHPLC with a pressure rating of 1200 bar.      System specifications                  Specification       Value                       Pressure range       0 – 1200 bar                 Flow range, gradient       20 – 2000 nL/min (recommended 100 – 1000 nL/min)                 Flow range, loading &amp; equilibration       up to 25 µL/min                 Retention time reproducibility       0.1 – 0.4% RSD within recommended flow range                 Pick-up volume range       0.10 – 18.00 µL (20 µL loop)                 Injection reproducibility       ≤ 0.2% RSD at 5 µL pick-up; ≤ 3.0% RSD at 0.1 µL pick-up                 Injection linearity       R ≥ 0.9985 for 0.5 – 10 µL; R ≥ 0.9995 for 0.3 – 1.6 µL                 Carry-over       &lt; 0.05% (caffeine)                 Gradient delay volume       &lt; 1 µL (mixing tee to venting tee)          ","url": "https://proteomicsresource.washington.edu/facility/instruments/EASYnLC/"
